# A triggered ability's text is fixed as it is put on the stack (CR 603.3) and it exists independently of its source
# (CR 113.7a): a text-changing effect on the source afterwards changes the permanent's text (CR 612.1), not the ability's.
# Trait Doctoring is a sorcery, so it can answer Starfield Shepherd's enters trigger only under Teferi, Time Raveler's +1
# ("you may cast sorcery spells as though they had flash"). It replaces Plains with Forest in the Shepherd's text, but the
# trigger already on the stack still searches for "a basic Plains card": it refuses the basic Forest and takes the Plains.
# Teferi is paid with a Plains and Black Lotus (blue); the warp cost {1}{W} with Mox Pearl and the Lotus's remaining blue;
# Trait Doctoring's {U} with Mox Sapphire.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Teferi, Time Raveler
Starfield Shepherd
Trait Doctoring
Plains
Forest
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x22

[Actions]
